units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice diamond 5.431
region box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 28.0855
pair_style tersoff
pair_coeff * * Si.tersoff Si
velocity all create 600.0 12345 mom yes rot yes
fix 1 all nvt temp 600 600 0.1
timestep 0.001
run 3000
unfix 1
reset_timestep 0
fix 2 all nve
compute myrdf all rdf 80 1 1
fix 3 all ave/time 5 200 1000 c_myrdf[*] file tersoff_rdf_lammps.gr mode vector
run 1000
write_data tersoff_rdf_216.data nocoeff
